rts de Football &mdash; Enfants / Jeunes</h2>\n<div class=\"sg-table-wrap\">\n<div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\" style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n<table class=\"sg-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Taille</th>\n<th>Tour de taille (cm)</th>\n<th class=\"hide-sm\">Hanches (cm)</th>\n<th>Hauteur (cm)</th>\n<th>&Acirc;ge (approx.)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>98/104</td>\n<td>52&ndash;55</td>\n<td class=\"hide-sm\">58&ndash;61</td>\n<td>96&ndash;104</td>\n<td class=\"sg-age\">3&ndash;4 ans</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>110/116</td>\n<td>54&ndash;58</td>\n<td class=\"hide-sm\">62&ndash;66</td>\n<td>105&ndash;117</td>\n<td class=\"sg-age\">5&ndash;6 ans</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>128</td>\n<td>59&ndash;62</td>\n<td class=\"hide-sm\">68&ndash;71</td>\n<td>123&ndash;128</td>\n<td class=\"sg-age\">7&ndash;8 ans</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>140</td>\n<td>63&ndash;67</td>\n<td class=\"hide-sm\">74&ndash;79</td>\n<td>135&ndash;140</td>\n<td class=\"sg-age\">9&ndash;10 ans</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>152</td>\n<td>66&ndash;72</td>\n<td class=\"hide-sm\">79&ndash;84</td>\n<td>147&ndash;152</td>\n<td class=\"sg-age\">11&ndash;12 ans</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>164</td>\n<td>71&ndash;75</td>\n<td class=\"hide-sm\">86&ndash;90</td>\n<td>159&ndash;164</td>\n<td class=\"sg-age\">13&ndash;14 ans</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>176</td>\n<td>74&ndash;78</td>\n<td class=\"hide-sm\">90&ndash;95</td>\n<td>170&ndash;176</td>\n<td class=\"sg-age\">15&ndash;16 ans</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sg-note\">\n<p><strong>Vous n'&ecirc;tes pas s&ucirc;r de votre taille ?</strong> Mesurez votre poitrine &agrave; son point le plus large et votre hauteur sans chaussures, puis comparez avec le tableau. En cas de doute, prenez la taille sup&eacute;rieure &mdash; les maillots personnalis&eacute;s ne peuvent pas &ecirc;tre &eacute;chang&eacute;s une fois imprim&eacute;s.</p>\n<p>Des questions ? <a href=\"/pages/contactez-nous\">Contactez notre &eacute;quipe</a> &mdash; nous sommes ravis de vous aider avant votre commande.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var btns = document.querySelectorAll('.sg-toggle-btn');\n  btns.forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      btns.forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });\n      btn.classList.add('active');\n      document.querySelectorAll('.sg-panel').forEach(function (p) { p.classList.remove('active'); });\n      document.getElementById('sg-' + btn.dataset.panel).classList.add('active');\n    });\n  });\n}());\n</script>",
